	ns alike. She has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Conan\, and released her 
	own Comedy Central special. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\
	, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT\nVenue: The United Theater on Broadway\nAddress:
	 929 S Broadway\, Los Angeles\, CA 90015\nTickets From: $59\n\nAbout Jessi
	ca Kirson\nJessica Kirson is a stand-up comedian\, actress\, and producer 
	known for her raw\, physical comedy style. She has been praised by Jerry S
	einfeld\, Louis C.K.\, and Chris Rock. Her Comedy Central special and podc
	ast Disgusting Hawk have earned her a devoted following. \nOfficial Ticket
	sResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commis
