	as become one of the most entertaining live performers in comedy. He has a
	ppeared in Next Friday\, Coming 2 America\, and is a regular on radio and 
	social media. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 
	9:45 PM PDT\nVenue: Hollywood Improv (The Main Room)\nAddress: 8162 Melros
	e Ave\, Hollywood\, CA 90046\nTickets From: $40\n\nAbout Michael Blackson\
	nMichael Blackson is a Ghanaian-American comedian and actor known as the “
	African King of Comedy.” He appeared in Next Friday and Coming 2 America a
	nd is a regular on The Breakfast Club. His live shows are known for explos
	ive crowd interaction and non-stop laughs. \nOfficial TicketsResale Ticket
