SUMMARY:Kevin Nealon LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260813T094701Z
DTSTART:20260814T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nKevin Nea
	lon is a beloved comedian and actor best known for his nine-year stint as 
	a cast member of NBC’s Saturday Night Live (1986-1995)\, where he created 
	iconic characters including ‘The Subliminal Man’ and ‘Hans and Franz\,’ an
	d served as a recurring anchor on ‘Weekend Update.’ \nNealon received crit
	ical acclaim for his role in the Showtime series Weeds\, which earned mult
	iple Golden Globe and Screen Actors Guild Award nominations. He has starre
	d alongside Adam Sandler in numerous films including Just Go with It\, Ang
	er Management\, Happy Gilmore\, and You Don’t Mess with the Zohan. \nHis d
	ry wit and likeable demeanor have made him a fan favorite for decades\, an
	d he continues to tour his stand-up comedy across the country. \nEvent Det
	ails\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00
	 PM)\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, 
	TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nAdditional Shows: Also performing Au
	gust 14 (9:30 PM) and August 15 (7:00 PM & 9:30 PM)\nFood & Beverage: 2-it
	em minimum per person once seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comed
	y Club (LOL San Antonio) is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destinat
	ion\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco\, ju
	st inside the loop and a few miles from the airport. \nThe intimate club s
	etting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat feels close to the 
	stage\, making for an incredibly personal and engaging comedy experience. 
	\nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, so guests can enjoy f
	ood and drinks throughout the show. Seating is first come\, first served b
	y section\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best seats. \nL
	OL San Antonio is part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club net
	work\, consistently bringing top-tier national touring comedians to San An
	tonio. \nWhat to Expect\nKevin Nealon delivers a full headlining stand-up 
	set showcasing his signature dry wit\, clever observations\, and the kind 
	of understated comedic genius that made him a household name on SNL. \nExp
	ect a polished\, engaging performance that draws on decades of experience 
	in stand-up\, television\, and film. \nThis is an 18+ event. Arrive early 
	to grab a great seat and enjoy the full club experience with food and drin
	ks before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $50 (p
	lus fees) \nTickets are available through official and resale channels: \n
	Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We ma
	y earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com
	/event/kevin-nealon-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Cal
	endar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kevin-nealon-live-at-laugh-out-loud-co
	medy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\
	, TX\, 78216\, USA
