	gh-energy stand-up comedy from one of NYC’s top headliners\nSharp observat
	ional humor and personal storytelling\nAn intimate club setting at one of 
	Philly’s premier comedy venues\nFull bar service with a 2-drink minimum\nA
	 night of non-stop laughs in the heart of Philadelphia\nMultiple show time
	s available — check Ticketmaster for all options\n\nVenue Information\nPun
	ch Line Philly is Philadelphia’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located at
	 33 E. Laurel Street in the Northern Liberties neighborhood. The intimate 
	showroom offers excellent sightlines from every seat\, full bar service\, 
	and a lively atmosphere that makes every show feel special. \nTicket Infor
