SUMMARY:Josh Johnson's Comedy Band Camp LIVE at Orpheum Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260813T094701Z
DTSTART:20260814T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJosh John
	son is a rising star in the stand-up comedy world\, best known for his sha
	rp wit\, incisive social commentary\, and effortlessly cool stage presence
	. A regular on The Daily Show and a Netflix special veteran\, Johnson has 
	built a devoted following with his ability to tackle complex topics — race
	\, culture\, politics — with disarming humor and intelligence. \nHis 2026 
	tour\, Comedy Band Camp\, is a unique and ambitious live experience that b
	lends stand-up comedy with live musical performance. Johnson brings togeth
	er a full band to create a show unlike anything else on the comedy circuit
	 — part concert\, part comedy special\, all entertainment. \nFans can expe
	ct Johnson’s signature blend of observational humor\, cultural critique\, 
	and storytelling\, all elevated by a live musical backdrop that adds energ
	y and spontaneity to every performance. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, 
	August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Orpheum Theatre\, 910 Hennepin
	 Avenue\, Minneapolis\, MN 55403\nTicket Price Range: $39 – $125\nAge Rest
	rictions: All ages welcome\; some content may be intended for mature audie
	nces\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Orpheum Theatre is one of Minneapolis’s most 
	iconic and beloved performance venues. Located in the heart of the Hennepi
	n Theatre District at 910 Hennepin Avenue\, this stunning 2\,600-seat hist
	oric theater has been a cornerstone of Twin Cities entertainment since 192
	1. \nThe Orpheum features ornate architecture\, plush seating\, excellent 
	sightlines from virtually every seat\, and world-class acoustics — making 
	it the perfect setting for a show that combines comedy and live music. The
	 venue offers a full bar\, concessions\, and accessible seating options th
	roughout. \nParking is available in several nearby ramps and surface lots 
	along Hennepin Avenue and in the surrounding downtown Minneapolis area. Th
	e venue is also easily accessible via Metro Transit light rail (Government
	 Plaza station is a short walk away). \nWhat to Expect\nJosh Johnson’s Com
	edy Band Camp is not your typical stand-up show. This is a full-scale live
	 event featuring Johnson performing alongside a live band\, creating a dyn
	amic and immersive comedy experience that blurs the line between concert a
	nd comedy special. \nExpect high-energy performances\, crowd interaction\,
	 and the kind of sharp\, culturally aware humor that has made Johnson one 
	of the most talked-about comedians of his generation. The Orpheum’s grand 
	setting adds an extra layer of spectacle to what promises to be an unforge
	ttable night. \nThis is a rare opportunity to see Josh Johnson in one of M
	inneapolis’s most prestigious venues — don’t miss it. \nTicket Information
	\nTickets range from $39 to $125 depending on seat location. Purchase offi
	cial tickets directly through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through 
	VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliat
	e links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://come
	dycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at-orpheum-theatr
	e/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at
	-orpheum-theatre/
LOCATION:Orpheum Theatre Minneapolis\, 910 Hennepin Avenue\, Minneapolis\, 
	MN\, 55403
