DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nNikki Glaser: The Stunning Tour LIVE at Premier Th
	eater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nOne of comedy’s hottest stars\, Nikki Gla
	ser\, brings her highly anticipated The Stunning Tour to the Premier Theat
	er at Foxwoods Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, CT on Friday\, August 14\, 
	2026. Known for her razor-sharp wit and fearlessly honest humor\, Nikki is
	 riding a massive wave of popularity following her acclaimed roast appeara
	nces and sold-out tours. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\
	nTime: 7:30 PM ET\nVenue: Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino\nAddre
	ss: 39 Norwich Westerly Road\, Mashantucket\, CT 06339\nAge Requirement: A
	ll Ages\nParking: On-site parking available \nAbout Nikki Glaser\nNikki Gl
	aser is one of the funniest and most fearless comedians working today. She
	 has hosted and appeared on numerous TV shows\, specials\, and podcasts\, 
	and became a household name after her show-stopping performance at the Tom
	 Brady Roast on Netflix. Her comedy is bold\, personal\, and always hilari
	ous. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of Nikki Glaser’s signature stand-
	up comedy\nCandid\, confessional humor that pushes boundaries\nOne of the 
	hottest touring comedians of 2026\nA world-class venue inside Foxwoods Res
	ort Casino\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Connecticut\n\nVenue Infor
	mation\nThe Premier Theater at Foxwoods Resort Casino is one of New Englan
	d’s premier entertainment venues\, located inside the world-famous Foxwood
	s Resort Casino in Mashantucket\, CT. The theater offers excellent sightli
	nes\, top-notch sound\, and easy access to dining and gaming. \nTicket Inf
	ormation\nTickets start from $106. Secure your seats now before they sell 
	out — this show is expected to be a hot ticket! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale
	 Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales ar
	e final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for 
	entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/nikki-glaser-the-stunning-tour-
	live-at-premier-theater-at-foxwoods-resort-casino/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
